      <h1 class="article-title">The Lausanne Covenant</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">1974</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">15 articles on world evangelization from the 1974 International Congress at Lausanne.</p>
      
      
